  "lead": "The Census vintage 2025 estimate put the United States at <b>341,784,857</b> on July 1, 2025 (SRC-617-01). Massachusetts was <b>7,154,084</b>, with domestic migration of <b>-33,340</b>, rank 47 of 51 (derived, SRC-617-01). Under the 2023 USDA rural-urban continuum codes, <b>98.5%</b> of Massachusetts 2020 county population lived in metro (RUCC 1-3) counties (SRC-617-02). The state has <b>11</b> metro counties and <b>3</b> nonmetro counties (SRC-617-02). <b>19.9%</b> of Massachusetts residents were 65 and over in 2025, rank 21 of 51 (derived, SRC-617-03). Census estimated <b>68,055</b> births and <b>59,636</b> deaths in Massachusetts in 2025 (SRC-617-01).",
